abstract: >-
  Scripts, certificates, run logs and Lean 4 verifications supporting the paper
  "The Sphere Packing Problem in Dimension 4 and the Twenty-Four-Cell Conjecture": the exact chamber certificates of the single-deviation bound, the
  covering bound, the root-system and 600-cell enumerations, the slack
  continuation, and the three-point semidefinite certificate for the
  twenty-three-contact case with its verification in exact rational, interval
  and Lean arithmetic. It also carries the two steps of the certificate of
  de Laat, Leijenhorst and de Muinck Keizer for the twenty-four-contact case
  that their own code leaves out, the construction of the zonal matrices and
  the four polynomial identities, recomputed here from their published data in
  exact rational arithmetic on an ordinary machine.
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22766562"
